    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.client.common.ClientSettingsPacket`.",
    "",
    "# Local stub",
    "",
    "`net.minestom.server.network.player.ClientSettings` lives in the `network.player`",
    "package, which is not part of this port, so [`ClientSettings`] is declared",
    "here with exactly the record components and the `NETWORK_TYPE` template Java",
    "defines. `MainHand` comes from the ported `entity` module and",
    "`ChatMessageType` from the ported `message` module; `Locale` is carried as",
    "its language tag, which is what `LOCALE_SERIALIZER` writes",
    "(`Locale::toLanguageTag`, read back by replacing `_` with `-`)."
  ],
